    {
      "id": "cf23814111cad766",
      "category": "legacy-USP",
      "kind": "fixed",
      "text": "Welcome to Virtual Squash! You are watching two autonomous A.I. players battle live on the glass showcourt. Ready to jump in? Use the menu on the left to play One Player against Club or Pro A.I., or start a Two-Human-Player One-v-One match! Play with Webcam Kinect-style body pose and arm swings, pair your smartphone as a Wii-style inertial racket, or use Keyboard and Mouse. Press K at any time to review the complete rules of squash!",
      "source": {
        "file": "src/audio_engine.js",
        "line": 243,
        "owner": "NARRATOR_USP_INVITES"
      },
      "expression": "'Welcome to Virtual Squash! You are watching two autonomous A.I. players battle live on the glass showcourt. Ready to jump in? Use the menu on the left to play One Player against Club or Pro A.I., or start a Two-Human-Player One-v-One match! Play with Webcam Kinect-style body pose and arm swings, pair your smartphone as a Wii-style inertial racket, or use Keyboard and Mouse. Press K at any time to review the complete rules of squash!'"
    },
    {
      "id": "91e9cdceb9c55175",
      "category": "legacy-USP",
      "kind": "fixed",
      "text": "Experience Physical Chess with full motion controls! For Kinect-style webcam play, click Enable Pose Cam in Step 4 to lunge and swing naturally in front of your camera—even using a back camera with a big-screen T.V.! For Wii-style motion play, scan the Pocket Racket QR code with your phone to swing and slice in 3D space. Or play immediately with mouse swipes and keys 1 through 5. Press K anytime to pause and view the complete rules of squash!",
      "source": {
        "file": "src/audio_engine.js",
        "line": 249,
        "owner": "NARRATOR_USP_INVITES"
      },
      "expression": "'Experience Physical Chess with full motion controls! For Kinect-style webcam play, click Enable Pose Cam in Step 4 to lunge and swing naturally in front of your camera—even using a back camera with a big-screen T.V.! For Wii-style motion play, scan the Pocket Racket QR code with your phone to swing and slice in 3D space. Or play immediately with mouse swipes and keys 1 through 5. Press K anytime to pause and view the complete rules of squash!'"
    },
    {
      "id": "31cde53b6c9f2daf",
      "category": "legacy-USP",
      "kind": "fixed",
      "text": "Ready to step on court? In Step 1 on the left menu, pick Club A.I. or Pro Chess A.I. for a solo match, or select One-v-One Match to invite a second human player! Even while watching this live A.I. exhibition, you can nudge their next shot with keys 1 through 5, or steer footwork with W, A, S, D. To review the official rules of squash, including Lets and Strokes, press K at any time!",
      "source": {
        "file": "src/audio_engine.js",
        "line": 255,
        "owner": "NARRATOR_USP_INVITES"
      },
      "expression": "'Ready to step on court? In Step 1 on the left menu, pick Club A.I. or Pro Chess A.I. for a solo match, or select One-v-One Match to invite a second human player! Even while watching this live A.I. exhibition, you can nudge their next shot with keys 1 through 5, or steer footwork with W, A, S, D. To review the official rules of squash, including Lets and Strokes, press K at any time!'"
    },
