    {
      "id": "0879e36699886290",
      "category": "briefing",
      "kind": "fixed",
      "text": "The user is always represented in the game as the red player. Squash is physical chess. Keep rails tight to the wall. Send drives and lobs deep, beyond the service box. Volley when the opening is there. Move your opponent before you attack. Watch the red player, then try the shots yourself.",
      "source": {
